OL,5,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,6,     FAfter a brutally murdered oil rig
OL,7,     Fworker is found in a burnt-out
OL,8,     Fcar, the quiet Scottish town soon
OL,9,     Fbecomes inflamed with rumours and
OL,10,     Ffear.
OL,11,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,12,     FIn 1978, trailblazing scientist Dr
OL,13,     FBrenda Page was found brutally
OL,14,     Fbeaten to death in her Aberdeen
OL,15,     Fhome. 40 years later, could a tiny
OL,16,     Ffleck of paint hold the key to
OL,17,     Fcatching her killer?
